flowchart TD
    accTitle: The Orchard content lifecycle
    accDescr: Discovery, currency inspection, and a designed request-intake path all feed one shared queue and one Gate 1 owner approval. Approved work moves through a research, authoring, and review ensemble to a second Gate 2 approval bound to the exact artifact digest, then commit, push, and a designed live-verification step. A Gate 2 denial returns the work for rework with a reason.

    subgraph INTAKE["Three intake paths, one shared queue"]
        direction LR
        kickoff["Discovery kicks off, monthly the 1st 06:00 UTC"] --> sources["Read the approved-source list"]
        sources --> storeDiscovered["Store discovered content"]
        storeDiscovered --> score["Score the discovered content"]
        score --> storeScores["Store the scores"]

        currencyInspect["Currency track inspects existing content, monthly the 15th 06:00 UTC"] --> currencyRecord["Record updates and flag stale content"]

        requestIntake["Request intake: labeled GitHub issue (designed, not built)"]
    end

    storeScores --> issue1{{"GitHub issue and alert: everything found, with scoring"}}
    currencyRecord --> issue1
    requestIntake -.-> issue1

    issue1 --> gate1{"Gate 1: owner approves on the comment"}
    gate1 -->|deny| noAuthority1["No delivery authority"]
    gate1 -->|approve| approvedTracker["Approved list entry, plus tracker work item"]

    approvedTracker --> orchestration["Orchestration: research, authoring, review agents"]
    orchestration --> storeWritten["Store the written content"]
    storeWritten --> issue2{{"Second GitHub issue: work-item link plus content"}}
    issue2 --> gate2{"Gate 2: approve or deny, bound to the exact artifact digest"}
    gate2 -->|deny, reason required| rework["No publication authority, work returns for rework"]
    rework --> orchestration
    gate2 -->|approve| commitPush["Commit and push to the central content store"]
    commitPush --> verifyLive["Verify the new content is live (designed, not wired)"]

    classDef pending stroke-dasharray: 6 4
    class requestIntake pending
    class verifyLive pending
